- no self-update: selfupdate.Bootstrap, its boot state, its settle timer and the restart exit are gone (the
  selfupdate package and server/update.go are removed by the build, see ../REMOVE)
- -addr and -proxy must be loopback addresses (default -addr 127.0.0.1:8787 instead of :8787)
- -admin-password-file (required): the admin password, set before the server listens
- -keys: the folder of the JWT signing key (upstream: next to the executable, read-only in the image)
- cmd/artex/loopback_test.go: sandbox-ai's test of loopbackOnly

